WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.509
Celebrate individual differences and explain why each learner is special

00:00:05.367 --> 00:00:09.872
Uniqueness: every person has different gifts and qualities. Creation: people of

00:00:09.872 --> 00:00:13.559
different faiths express beliefs about the origin of life.

00:00:14.367 --> 00:00:18.995
Gratitude: appreciating people and the world around us. Stewardship: taking

00:00:18.995 --> 00:00:24.086
responsible care of natural resources. Respect: showing kindness to people with

00:00:24.086 --> 00:00:25.012
different beliefs.

00:00:25.867 --> 00:00:29.920
Create a respect poster showing three ways to care for people and nature.
